  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match the thermodynamics processes taking place in a system with the correct conditions. In the table : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is the heat supplied, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>W</mi></math> is the work done and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi></math> is change in internal energy of the system.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 350px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Process</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Condition</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td>Adiabatic</td>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td>Isothermal</td>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td>Isochoric</td>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p>Isobaric</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
    "image": null
  },
